  "approach": "Teach the three plural rules (vowel + s, consonant + es, z to c + es) with the articles los and las, then practice forming plurals in phrases.",
  "coverage": [
    "A noun ending in a vowel adds -s: libro → libros, casa → casas, café → cafés",
    "A noun ending in a consonant adds -es: papel → papeles, ciudad → ciudades, profesor → profesores",
    "A final z becomes c before -es: lápiz → lápices, luz → luces, vez → veces",
    "el → los, la → las",
    "Words ending in -ción add -es and drop the accent: canción → canciones",
    "Adjectives and articles follow the noun: los libros nuevos"
  ],
  "layout_fallback": false,
